      "en": "The people of the land have used oppression and exercised robbery. Yes, they have troubled the poor and needy, and have oppressed the foreigner wrongfully.",
      "ko": "이 땅 백성은 강포하며 늑탈하여 가난하고 궁핍한 자를 압제하였으며 우거한 자를 불법하게 학대하였으므로",
      "source_text_hash": "0fb0c42f0793cadecd800ffb424d2bbe1d0b0e36a59a5c471dc65059f7073c9e",
      "translation_text_hash": "fb578654f0cfb91d1de870cb7b8c6cafe165d7f582de16f25d2f0dbcb13825bb",
